    "blog_redes_sociais_para_empresas": {
      "k1": "Social Media",
      "k2": "Social Media",
      "k3": "Social Media for Businesses: How to Strengthen Your Brand and Attract Clients",
      "k4": "Practical positioning and content strategies for companies looking to turn engagement into real business opportunities.",
      "k5": "Social media channels have evolved from casual entertainment into vital corporate storefronts. Maintaining an active, purposeful presence on Instagram, LinkedIn, and other channels is essential to nurture authority and generate commercial leads.",
      "k6": "1. Strategic Positioning and Visual Cohesion",
      "k7": "First impressions are decisive on social feeds. A corporate profile with consistent branding, a sharp logo, and an outcome-focused bio conveys instant credibility and brand recall.",
      "k8": "2. Value-First and Solution-Driven Content",
      "k9": "The most frequent mistake companies make on social media is relentless direct selling. The winning approach balances educational content, behind-the-scenes insights, and customer success stories. Solving customer problems naturally drives incoming inquiries.",
      "k10": "3. Bridging Social Traffic to Your Website",
      "k11": "Social platforms serve as high-volume attraction funnels. The strategic objective is directing engaged prospects toward environments engineered for conversion — such as landing pages, service catalogs, or direct WhatsApp sales consultations.",
      "k12": "4. Conclusion: Consistency is the Foundation of Growth",
      "k13": "Building brand power does not require random daily posting, but rather disciplined planning, value delivery, and alignment with business objectives.",
      "k14": "Looking to elevate your company’s social media presence?",
      "k15": "CONEXUS manages strategy, graphic design, and content planning to make your brand stand out.",
      "k16": "Explore Social Media Management",
      "k17": "Chat on WhatsApp"
    },
